    "detailed_description": "&quot;Original&quot; is an action puzzle game that tests operation<br><br>O is a robot specially born to explore the secret realm, it is invincible.<br>You will control O to go to a rare and uninhabited secret realm, control the direction and distance of  O during the adventure, travel through the secret realm to find treasures and bring them back to the transmitter.<br>During the adventure, you will face various ancient organs, difficult terrain, and magical creatures. Use your reaction and wisdom to solve various difficulties along the way!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this game, you can:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Challenge 100+ levels and bring back the treasures.<br></li><li>Use collected treasures to synthesize useful or interesting items.<br></li><li> Obtain the memory fragments of the area during the adventure, and get a glimpse of the history that once happened<br></li><li>From the low-text design, you can feel the story belonging to the secret realm.<br></li><li>Enjoy the art created by humans and AI.</li></ul>",
